## 2. The Universal ML Pipeline

Every single ML project follows these 5 steps. No exceptions.

```
Step 1: Load & Explore data        → Pandas
Step 2: Clean & Prepare data       → Pandas
Step 3: Split into Train/Test      → Scikit-learn
Step 4: Train the model            → Scikit-learn
Step 5: Evaluate the model         → Scikit-learn
```

