## 8. Encoding — Converting Categories to Numbers

ML models only understand numbers. Text must be converted.

```python
# Method 1 — map() for binary categories
df['Sex'] = df['Sex'].map({'male': 0, 'female': 1})

# Method 2 — apply() with lambda for custom logic
df['Class_type'] = df['Pclass'].apply(
    lambda x: 'High' if x == 1 else 'Low'
)
```

> **Rule:** Everything going into an ML model must be a number.

